# demo-app

Rust core packaged as a debug Android APK (com.example.demo_app) for arm64-v8a and x86_64.

The host build and tests need no Android SDK:

```sh
bazel build //...
bazel test //...
```

The APK and its launchers are tagged manual. The APK build fetches the pinned
Android SDK and NDK, so it needs no ANDROID_HOME:

```sh
bazel build :demo-app_apk_file
bazel test :demo-app_check_test
```

Only the launchers need adb and a running emulator:

```sh
bazel run :demo-app_install
bazel run :demo-app_start
bazel run :demo-app_log
```

The launchers name emulator-5554. The APK is debug-signed, so no keys are needed.
The app ID, ABIs and API level are attributes of `:demo-app_apk` in BUILD.bazel.
